OL,3,APhilippine police obtain warrant to
OL,4,Asearch Thomas Markle's devices
OL,5,
OL,6,FPhilippine police have obtained a
OL,7,Fwarrant to examine devices seized from
OL,8,Fthe former home of Thomas Markle,
OL,9,Ffather of the Duchess of Sussex.
OL,11,FEarlier this month, it was reported
OL,12,Fthat hundreds of images of child sexual
OL,13,Fabuse allegedly belonging to Thomas
OL,14,FMarkle Sr, 82, had been found at the
OL,15,Fproperty in the Philippines.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
